        <span class="text-white text-[13.5px] font-bold tracking-tight">이능관리위원회</span>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] text-[#888] leading-relaxed m-0">
        (00000) 서울특별시 종로구 ○○로 ○○ (가상)<br />
        대표전화 1551-0000 · FAX 02-XXX-XXXX<br />
        사업자등록번호 ○○○-○○-○○○○○ · 통신판매업신고번호 제 ○○○○-서울○○-○○○○○○ 호
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="imc-footer__cols">
      <div>
        <p class="imc-footer__col-title">정책·제도</p>
        <div class="imc-footer__links">
          <a href={url('about/')}>등재 안내</a>
